    "title": "Configuring and\n\t Upgrading Hosts",
    "content": "<div class=\"main-content\">\n<div class=\"dita\">\n<div class=\"topic section\">\n<div class=\"topic topic concept\" id=\"GUID-F83027FC-94A0-46ED-BDB2-CB71A7CAC757-en\" lang=\"en\">\n<h1 class=\"title\" id=\"GUID-F83027FC-94A0-46ED-BDB2-CB71A7CAC757-en_GUID-B4235182-3CF7-4289-AEFB-4E1566869D96\"><div>Configuring and\n\t Upgrading Hosts</div></h1>\n<div class=\"shortdesc\" id=\"GUID-F83027FC-94A0-46ED-BDB2-CB71A7CAC757-en_shortdesc_40809CFC59E44B30B171D6067017A769\"><div>You can upgrade\n\t your hosts using the upgrade coordinator.</div></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
