        "label": "Manage Existing and Additional VCF Instances",
        "url": "https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-1/fleet-management/managing-identity-and-access-using-vcf-single-sign-on/what-is/join-change-and-remove-vcf-instances-from-an-existing-vcf-single-sign-on-configuration.html"
