  "https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-service-administration-and-development/9-1/provision-and-manage-virtual-machines.html": {
    "title": "Provision and Manage Virtual Machines",
    "content": "<div class=\"main-content\">\n<div class=\"dita\">\n<div class=\"topic section\">\n<div class=\"topic topic concept\" id=\"GUID-9ea7304a-0182-46a5-a5d5-93d79be008f2-en\">\n<h1 class=\"title\" id=\"GUID-9ea7304a-0182-46a5-a5d5-93d79be008f2-en_id-63c8f433-ecbd-4be8-aa14-466a4aa7c9f4\"><div>Provision and Manage Virtual Machines</div></h1>\n<div class=\"shortdesc\" id=\"GUID-9ea7304a-0182-46a5-a5d5-93d79be008f2-en_id-8406ddbe-c9c6-4aea-f5be-00713ed20991\"><div>You can use a variety of methods to provision VMs with the VM Service in <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-9ea7304a-0182-46a5-a5d5-93d79be008f2-en_id-f1d418be-5502-4c6e-879b-11130d76dd74\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">vSphere Supervisor</div></span>.</div></div>\n<div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-9ea7304a-0182-46a5-a5d5-93d79be008f2-en_id-b72e366f-773f-4461-84b4-7f98ba4c244f\"><div>If you have access to <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-9ea7304a-0182-46a5-a5d5-93d79be008f2-en_id-01abc384-e5b0-449a-a428-c1776381f7d7\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF Automation</div></span> for All Apps, the Iaas Services Console provides a graphical user interface for provisioning VMs using the VM Service.</div></div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-9ea7304a-0182-46a5-a5d5-93d79be008f2-en_id-28b1c37c-bf40-4946-a725-8b2c528a872a\"><div>If the VI administrator has deployed the Local Consumption Interface, the Local Consumption Interface also provides a graphical user interface for provisioning VMs.</div></div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-9ea7304a-0182-46a5-a5d5-93d79be008f2-en_id-19d9af33-1ac0-4e90-c3fb-b845892c2a2c\"><div>In addition, the VCF CLI and kubectl provide command-line interfaces for provisioning VMs. If you have the access to <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-9ea7304a-0182-46a5-a5d5-93d79be008f2-en_id-d2fd9567-b881-42f5-d08a-4054e50adb12\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF Automation</div></span> for All Apps, use VCF CLI and <span class=\"keyword cmdname\" id=\"GUID-9ea7304a-0182-46a5-a5d5-93d79be008f2-en_id-5ccda168-0cea-412d-d3c8-3cc1f13e1a7b\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">kubectl</div></span> in the namespace of your organization, provided to by your organization administrator. </div></div><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-9ea7304a-0182-46a5-a5d5-93d79be008f2-en_id-1232a844-f96b-4ed0-8713-6bdb9c560237\"><div><h2 class=\"title\" id=\"GUID-9ea7304a-0182-46a5-a5d5-93d79be008f2-en_id-e3978e95-edf8-41a1-fcf0-3febf0682f03\"><div>What to Read Next</div></h2>\n<ul class=\"ul\" id=\"GUID-9ea7304a-0182-46a5-a5d5-93d79be008f2-en_id-fcb4d28a-a605-4423-87c1-a1306458b52c\"><div><li class=\"li\" id=\"GUID-9ea7304a-0182-46a5-a5d5-93d79be008f2-en_id-dcb2c581-2984-4de3-da71-3b91c9ea3d26\"><div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-9ea7304a-0182-46a5-a5d5-93d79be008f2-en_id-73cee166-bf2d-40b4-fd3e-bcd12adba9c5\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"html\" data-scope=\"external\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/bin/gethidpage?ux-context-string=vmservice-1&amp;appid=vcf-consumption&amp;language=&amp;format=rendered\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">Provision a VM Using Self-Service</a></div></div></div></li><li class=\"li\" id=\"GUID-9ea7304a-0182-46a5-a5d5-93d79be008f2-en_id-83c5810b-7341-4102-e007-2dfee2f8677d\"><div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-9ea7304a-0182-46a5-a5d5-93d79be008f2-en_id-57cdad83-9013-4d3e-c703-185895aafb2e\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-service-administration-and-development/9-1/provision-and-manage-virtual-machines/deploying-and-managing-virtual-machines-in-vsphere-iaas-control-plane.html\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Deploying and Managing Virtual Machines in vSphere Supervisor</a></div></div></div></li></div></ul></div></section></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-service-administration-and-development/9-1/provision-and-manage-virtual-machines.html",
    "subpages": [
      {
        "label": "Taking and Managing Snapshots of VMs Created Through the VM Service",
        "url": "https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-service-administration-and-development/9-1/provision-and-manage-virtual-machines/taking-and-managing-vm-snapshots.html"
      },
      {
        "label": "Deploying and Managing Virtual Machines in vSphere Supervisor",
        "url": "https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-service-administration-and-development/9-1/provision-and-manage-virtual-machines/deploying-and-managing-virtual-machines-in-vsphere-iaas-control-plane.html"
      }
    ]
  },
